        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಜಲಾಶಯ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಜಲಾಶಯ — jalāśaya — \"a reservoir\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಈ ವರ್ಷ ಜಲಾಶಯ ಪೂರ್ತಿ ತುಂಬಿದೆ. ī varṣa jalāśaya pūrti tumbide. This year the reservoir is completely full."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಜಲ, water, plus ಆಶಯ, a receptacle."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಜಲಾಶಯ (jalāśaya) is built from two Sanskrit words: jala, \"water\" (CDIAL 5155), and āśaya, \"a resting place, a receptacle\" (CDIAL 1453)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
