              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನದಿಗೆ ಅಡ್ಡವಾಗಿ ದೊಡ್ಡ ಅಣೆಕಟ್ಟು ಕಟ್ಟಿದ್ದಾರೆ. nadige aḍḍavāgi doḍḍa aṇekaṭṭu kaṭṭiddāre. A big dam has been built across the river."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಣೆ, a dam, plus ಕಟ್ಟು, to build."
            }
