              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಣೆಕಟ್ಟು (aṇekaṭṭu) is a native Kannada compound of aṇe, \"a dam, a dike\" (DEDR 122), and ಕಟ್ಟು, \"to bind, to build\" (DEDR 1147)."
